// Redblue comparison tests: the symbol forms of `==`, `!=`, `<`, `<=`, `>` and
// `>=`.
//
// These operators were documented (`README.md:18`, `SPEC.md:277-282`,
// `docs/GRAMMAR.md:93-98`) but the lexer had no arm for any of them, so a
